<div class="blog-content">
<div style="text-align:left;"><div style="height: 10px; overflow: hidden;"></div> <a class="wsite-button wsite-button-small wsite-button-normal" href="../../3288026126303402120529289-2347835948.html" target="_blank"> <span class="wsite-button-inner">研究內容</span> </a> <div style="height: 10px; overflow: hidden;"></div></div> <div class="paragraph"><span><span style="color:rgb(56, 118, 29); font-weight:700"><font size="5">雜食性</font></span></span><br/><span><span style="color:rgb(37, 37, 37); font-weight:700">家豬</span><span style="color:rgb(37, 37, 37)">，野豬被人類馴化後所變成，獠牙比野豬短，是人類的家畜之一，一般來說，家豬是指人類蓄養多供食用的豬種。</span></span><br/></div> <div class="paragraph"><span><span style="color:rgb(57, 85, 220)">豬一年生產</span><span style="color:rgb(57, 85, 220)">2.2次一胎生8</span><span style="color:rgb(57, 85, 220); font-weight:700">~</span><span style="color:rgb(57, 85, 220)">12隻小豬  </span></span><br/><br/><span><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight:700">豬正在吸奶</span></span></div> <div><div class="wsite-image wsite-image-border-none" style="padding-top:0px;padding-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;margin-right:0px;text-align:left"> <a> <img alt="圖片" src="../../uploads/2/9/4/4/2944166/2018-01-10-19-32-17_orig.png" style="width:auto;max-width:100%"/> </a> <div style="display:block;font-size:90%"></div> </div></div> <div class="paragraph"><strong><span><font color="#2a2a2a">豬的小時候</font></span></strong></div> <div><div class="wsite-image wsite-image-border-none" style="padding-top:10px;padding-bottom:10px;margin-left:0px;margin-right:0px;text-align:left"> <a> <img alt="圖片" src="../../uploads/2/9/4/4/2944166/2018-01-10-19-44-57_orig.png" style="width:auto;max-width:100%"/> </a> <div style="display:block;font-size:90%"></div> </div></div> <div class="paragraph"><span><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0)">通常豬媽媽有五到七對奶頭</span></span><br/><span><span style="color:rgb(255, 0, 0)">食用豬的飼養時間</span></span><br/><span><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0)">小豬出生到110公斤賣出 </span></span><br/><span><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0)">大約需要五個半月到六個半月時間</span></span><br/><span><span style="color:rgb(255, 0, 0)">豬的懷孕周期</span><span style="color:rgb(255, 0, 0)">    </span></span><span><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0)">母豬的懷孕周期為114天</span></span><br/><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0)"></span></div>
